---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.LinksetDataDeleteFound(search: string, pass: string): {any}`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list llLinksetDataDeleteFound(string search, string pass);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The <b>llLinksetDataDeleteFound</b> function finds and attempts to delete all keys in the data store that match <b>pattern</b>. This function will delete protected key-value pairs only if the matching pass phrase is passed in the <b>pass</b> parameter. The function returns a list, the first entry in the list is the number of keys deleted, the second entry in the list is the number of keys that could not be deleted due to a non-matching pass phrase.
If this function successfully deletes any keys from the datastore it will trigger a linkset_data event with the type of LINKSET_DATA_MULTIDELETE, the key name will consist of a comma separated list of the key names removed from the datastore.</p>
  <p>Returns a list of the number of keys deleted or skipped.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>search / pattern</td>
          <td>A regular expression describing which keys to delete.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>pass</td>
          <td>Optional pass phrase to delete protected keys.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

